6 (1.3&#x02013;2.1)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><xref ref-type="other" rid="bib7">Cybulski <italic>et al</italic> (2004b)</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Breast</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">3.3 (2.4&#x02013;4.3)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">1.6 (1.4&#x02013;1.9)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><xref ref-type="other" rid="bib8">Cybulski <italic>et al</italic> (2007a)</xref></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Colon</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">1.0 (0.5&#x02013;1.8)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">1.5 (1.2&#x02013;2.0)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50"><xref ref-type="other" rid="bib9">Cybulski <italic>et al</italic> (2007b)</xref></td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t1-fn1"><label/><p>CI=confidence interval; OR=odds ratio.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Distribution of 431 cancers observed in first-degree relatives</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="char" char="."/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Cancer site</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>Number</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Prostate</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">68</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Female genital</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">64</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Breast</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">59</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Colon</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="."